    "detailed_description": "A village builder / survival game.<br><br>Start out with your town center and gather food to survive. Expand your village to have farms, windmills, and houses for more people to live in. Learn how to hunt, farm and mine, and build a thriving community. Exploring, you find oases, antelopes, and the ruins of an ancient monument. <br><br>As night falls, monsters lurk in the dark and you'll need to be on your guard.  Meet a strange, distant traveler along the way, and try to prevent your imminent demise . . .<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390010/extras/b3d47164541c1ad6cb41a72edfd27e78.poster.avif?t=1639497917\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390010/extras/b3d47164541c1ad6cb41a72edfd27e78.webm?t=1639497917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390010/extras/b3d47164541c1ad6cb41a72edfd27e78.mp4?t=1639497917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 resources to collect<br></li><li>10+ different jobs to assign<br></li><li>20+ structures to build<br></li><li>day-night cycle<br></li><li>~4+ hours of playtime<br></li><li>3 save slots for different playthroughs</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390010/extras/c350ac25322f0cc81d29044611c576b9.avif?t=1639497917\" /></div><br>Sokpop makes a new game every two weeks!<br>Subscribe for 3$ per month at ",
